<title>USA: Iraq wheat tender results due late this week-trade.</title>
<headline>Iraq wheat tender results due late this week-trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>It may be Wednesday or later this week before results are known on Iraq's tender for 50,000 tonnes U.S. hard red winter wheat, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>Exporters submitted offers Monday and the offers are valid through Wednesday, exporters said.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't think they (Iraq) will decide before tomorrow (Wednesday),&quot; said one exporter.</p>
<p>Iraq seeks 25,000 tonnes for April shipment and 25,000 for May.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
